<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Portfolio Ahmad Ardi</title>

    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #0f172a;
            color: white;
        }

        header {
            background: #1e293b;
            padding: 20px 8%;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }

        header h2 {
            color: #38bdf8;
        }

        nav a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin-left: 20px;
        }

        .hero {
            min-height: 80vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 30px;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 45px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .hero h1 span {
            color: #38bdf8;
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 18px;
            color: #cbd5e1;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        .button {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 25px;
            padding: 14px 30px;
            background: #0284c7;
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 30px;
        }

        .about {
            background: #1e293b;
            padding: 60px 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .about h2 {
            color: #38bdf8;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .about p {
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        .skills {
            padding: 60px 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .skills h2 {
            color: #38bdf8;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .card {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #1e293b;
            padding: 25px;
            margin: 10px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            width: 200px;
        }

        footer {
            background: #1e293b;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 25px;
            color: #cbd5e1;
        }

    </style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
    <h2>AHMAD ARDI</h2>

    <nav>
        <a href="#home">Home</a>
        <a href="#about">Tentang</a>
        <a href="#skills">Keahlian</a>
    </nav>
</header>

<section class="hero" id="home">

    <h1>Halo, Saya <span>Ahmad Ardi</span></h1>

    <p>
        Selamat datang di website pribadi saya.<br>
        Saya seorang mahasiswa yang sedang belajar
        teknologi dan pemrograman web.
    </p>

    <a href="#about" class="button">Kenali Saya</a>

</section>

<section class="about" id="about">

    <h2>Tentang Saya</h2>

    <p>
        Nama saya Ahmad Ardi.<br>
        Saya memiliki ketertarikan dalam dunia teknologi,
        komputer, dan pengembangan website.<br>
        Saya terus belajar untuk meningkatkan kemampuan
        di bidang pemrograman.
    </p>

</section>

<section class="skills" id="skills">

    <h2>Keahlian Saya</h2>

    <div class="card">
        <h3>HTML</h3>
        <p>Membuat struktur website.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h3>CSS</h3>
        <p>Mendesain tampilan website.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h3>Python</h3>
        <p>Belajar dasar pemrograman.</p>
    </div>

</section>

<footer>
    <p>© 2026 Ahmad Ardi | Website Portfolio</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
